  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Debt management capacity building research</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DFID places significant value on working towards debt sustainability in developing countries, this research work will add value to DFID&#x2019;s thinking and policy development relating to debt management capacity building in developing countries, and how DFID could potentially make a positive impact in this space. It will particularly focus on DFID&#x2019;s priority countries, drawing on case studies where relevant to identify need and evaluate existing facilities.</narrative>
  </description>
